    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DID301 · Chapter 1 · Session 6</span>\n<h2>Session 6 — Five Guidelines for better Data visualisation</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 10711 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DID301 · Chương 1 · Buổi 6</span>\n<h2>Buổi 6 — Five Guidelines for better Data visualisation</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 10711 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I, T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">see session 5</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I, T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">xem buổi 5</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Five Guidelines for better Data visualisation<br><br>- Show the Data<br><br>- Reduce the Clutter<br><br>- Integrate the Graphics &amp; Text<br><br>- Avoid the Spaghetti Chart<br><br>- Start with Gray</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>- Book: Data Visualisation - Page 31 - 58</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>- Participate in class's activities: asks questions, answer questions.<br><br>- Read the syllabus<br><br>- Read Internet materials: <a href=\"http://book.visualisingdata.com/chapter/2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://book.visualisingdata.com/chapter/2</a><br><br>- Exercise Internet materials: <a href=\"http://book.visualisingdata.com/chapter/2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://book.visualisingdata.com/chapter/2</a></p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">📑 The slides for this session are in <strong>session 5</strong> (Slot 05-06 - Part A, Slot 05-06 - Part B) — the deck covers several sessions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">📑 Slide của buổi này nằm ở <strong>buổi 5</strong> (Slot 05-06 - Part A, Slot 05-06 - Part B) — một deck dùng cho nhiều buổi.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
