    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DID301 · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DID301 · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Data Visualisation - A handbook for Data Driven Design</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Andy Kirk · SAGE Publications · 2019 · 2nd · ISBN <code>9781526468925</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Visual Journalism, Infographics from the world's best newsrooms and design</strong></p><p>Javier Errea &amp; Gestalten · Gestalten · 2017 · ISBN <code>978-3-89955-919-4</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Information Graphic</strong></p><p>Sandra Rendgen, Julius Wiedemann · TASCHEN · 2020 · ISBN <code>978-3836583831</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>History of Information Graphics</strong></p><p>Sandra Rendgen, Julius Wiedemann · TASCHEN · 2019 · ISBN <code>978-3836567671</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>The Book of Circles: Visualizing Spheres of Knowledge: (with over 300 beautiful circular artworks, infographics and illustrations from across history)</strong></p><p>Manuel Lima · Princeton Architectural Press · 2017 · Illustrated edition · ISBN <code>9781616895280</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Information is beautifull</strong></p><p>David McCandless · Harper Collins Publishers · 2013 · ISBN <code>978 000 7492893</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Storytelling with data, Let's Practice!</strong></p><p>Cole Nussbaumer Knaflic · John Wiley &amp; Sons · 2020 · ISBN <code>978-1-119-62149-2</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Information Design Workbook, Revised and Updated: Graphic approaches, solutions, and inspiration + 30 case studies</strong></p><p>Kim Baer · ‎Rockport Publishers · 2021 · Revised edition · ISBN <code>978-0-2 ‎ 978-163159805031-19311-5</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Cool Infographics, Effective Communication with Data Visualization and Design</strong></p><p>Randy Kru · John Wiley &amp; Sons · 2013 · ISBN <code>978-1-118-58230-5</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Data Sketches: A journey of imagination, exploration, and beautiful data visualizations (AK Peters Visualization Series)</strong></p><p>Nadieh Bremer, Shirley Wu · A K Peters/CRC Press · 2021 · 1st · ISBN <code>978-0367000080</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Infographic, The power of Visual Stroryelling</strong></p><p>Jason Lankow, Josh Ritchie, Ross Crooks · John Wiley &amp; Sons · 2012</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>2. All relevant data visualizations: The digital companion site for the book, 'Visualising Data: A Handbook for Data Driven Design. <a href=\"http://book.visualisingdata.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://book.visualisingdata.com</a></strong></p><p>Internet</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>All relevant data visualizations. Retrived from: <a href=\"https://datavizproject.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://datavizproject.com</a></strong></p><p>Internet</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>An open source data visualization framework. Retrived from: <a href=\"https://rawgraphs.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://rawgraphs.io/</a></strong></p><p>Internet</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Research and data to make progress against the world’s largest problems. Retrived from: <a href=\"https://ourworldindata.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://ourworldindata.org/</a></strong></p><p>Internet</p></div>"
